{"forumTopic": {"authorId": 34082637, "authorThumbnailName": "34082637-kg.jpg?t=2026-05-23-06-15-25", "authorUserDisplayName": "Fususu", "authorUserName": "phuongncn", "comments": [{"id": 3523648, "postDate": "2026-09-12T10:10:57.213Z", "rawMarkdown": "The queue is already quite long, and some teams have multiple members. Imagine how many notebook versions a large team might save in a single day. Every time I want to save a version, I may have to wait behind all of those jobs.\n\nWould it make sense to introduce a limit on the number of versions each team can save per day, or some kind of fair-share queue policy?\n", "content": "<p>The queue is already quite long, and some teams have multiple members. Imagine how many notebook versions a large team might save in a single day. Every time I want to save a version, I may have to wait behind all of those jobs.</p>\n<p>Would it make sense to introduce a limit on the number of versions each team can save per day, or some kind of fair-share queue policy?</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Van-Phuc Huynh", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/2106526-kg.jpg?t=2025-01-11-10-15-51", "url": "/hvanphucs112", "tier": "EXPERT", "id": 2106526, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"totalVotes": 1, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 1}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 279, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"enabled": true, "teamLeader": {"displayName": "Van-Phuc Huynh", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/2106526-kg.jpg?t=2025-01-11-10-15-51", "url": "/hvanphucs112", "userName": "hvanphucs112", "tier": "EXPERT", "id": 2106526, "profileUrl": "/hvanphucs112", "performanceTier": "EXPERT", "userId": 2106526, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": "If you want to go for #1 and turn impossible problems into solvable ones, join my team. We\u2019re pushing a high-impact idea forward\u2014and we need more GPU power to take it further. Everyone is welcome, especially if you can support with GPU resources."}}, {"id": 3521962, "postDate": "2026-09-07T18:29:37.753Z", "rawMarkdown": "Our notebook is also being queued for more than a day and still queuing.,,,,", "content": "<p>Our notebook is also being queued for more than a day and still queuing.,,,,</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Patrick Chan", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/58279-kg.jpeg", "url": "/drpatrickchan", "tier": "MASTER", "id": 58279, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"totalVotes": 1, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 1}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 13, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Patrick Chan", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/58279-kg.jpeg", "url": "/drpatrickchan", "userName": "drpatrickchan", "tier": "MASTER", "id": 58279, "profileUrl": "/drpatrickchan", "performanceTier": "MASTER", "userId": 58279, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3521824, "postDate": "2026-09-07T08:47:24.590Z", "rawMarkdown": "Today > 5hrs ????![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F34082637%2F4c69748671eac9beab82d9923f6f331e%2FScreenshot%202026-09-07%20at%2015.46.51.png?generation=1788770868738562&alt=media)", "content": "<p>Today &gt; 5hrs ????<img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F34082637%2F4c69748671eac9beab82d9923f6f331e%2FScreenshot%202026-09-07%20at%2015.46.51.png?generation=1788770868738562&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Fususu", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/34082637-kg.jpg?t=2026-05-23-06-15-25", "url": "/phuongncn", "tier": "EXPERT", "id": 34082637, "progressionOptOut": false}, "aut