 complied\u2026.</p>", "replies": [{"id": 3521596, "postDate": "2026-09-06T12:57:09.280Z", "rawMarkdown": "And now I have an official score, but the NB is still queued... what's going on???\n@macruzbar \n\n", "content": "<p>And now I have an official score, but the NB is still queued\u2026 what's going on???\n<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/macruzbar\" target=\"_blank\">@macruzbar</a> </p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Benedicte HELFER", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/16480284-kg.jpg?t=2025-08-30-16-46-17", "url": "/benedictehelfer", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 16480284, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"canUpvote": true}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 178, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Benedicte HELFER", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/16480284-kg.jpg?t=2025-08-30-16-46-17", "url": "/benedictehelfer", "userName": "benedictehelfer", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 16480284, "profileUrl": "/benedictehelfer", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 16480284, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}], "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Benedicte HELFER", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/16480284-kg.jpg?t=2025-08-30-16-46-17", "url": "/benedictehelfer", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 16480284, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"totalVotes": 2, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 2}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 178, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Benedicte HELFER", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/16480284-kg.jpg?t=2025-08-30-16-46-17", "url": "/benedictehelfer", "userName": "benedictehelfer", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 16480284, "profileUrl": "/benedictehelfer", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 16480284, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3523266, "postDate": "2026-09-10T23:49:52.980Z", "rawMarkdown": "Hi @benedictehelfer -- thank you for your patience as I looked into this matter. First, I wanted to clarify some technical aspects. Your submission has two stages: a short wait for a machine (queue), then the notebook actually runs (runtime). ARC-AGI-3 allows a long compute window, and most submissions use nearly all of it \u2014 so the multi-hour time you're seeing is mainly your notebook executing, not waiting in line. That part is expected and isn't a sign anything's stuck.\n\nThen, as far as capacity goes, there were some genuine queue backups earlier in the week when capacity was tight; those have since cleared. If your notebook shows finished/scored but still displays \"queued,\" that's a separate status-display glitch we're looking into \u2014 your score is valid.\n\nI hope this helps! \n\nGood luck in the rest of the competition, \n\nMar\u00eda", "content": "<p>Hi <a href=\"/benedictehelfer\" target=\"_blank\">@benedictehelfer</a> -- thank you for your patience as I looked into this matter. First, I wanted to clarify some technical aspects. Your submission has two stages: a short wait for a machine (queue), then the notebook actually runs (runtime). ARC-AGI-3 allows a long compute window, and most submissions use nearly all of it \u2014 so the multi-hour time you're seeing is mainly your notebook executing, not waiting in line. That part is expected and isn't a sign anything's stuck.</p>\n<p>Then, as far as capacity goes, there were some genuine queue backups earlier in the week when capacity was tight; those have since cleared. If your notebook shows finished/scored but still displays \"queued,\" that's a separate status-display glitch we're looking into \u2014 your score is valid.</p>\n<p>I hope this helps! </p>\n<p>Good luck in the rest of the competition, </p>\n<p>Mar\u00eda</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Mar\u00eda Cruz", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/19579895-kg.jpg?t=2025-01-23-22-51-30", "url": "/macruzbar", "tier": "STAFF", "id": 19579895, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "ADMIN", "votes": {"totalVotes": 1, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 1}, "kernelVersion": 0, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Mar\u00eda Cruz", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/19579895-kg.jpg?t=2025-01-23-22-51-30", "url": "/macruzbar", "userName": "macruzbar", "tier": "STAFF", "id": 19579895, "profileUrl": "/macruzbar", "performanceTier": "STAFF", "userId": 19579895, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}], "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Benedicte HELFER", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/16480284-kg.jpg?t=2025-08-30-16-46-17", "url": "/benedictehelfer", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 16480284, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"totalVotes": 1, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 1}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 178, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Benedicte HELFER", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/16480284-kg.jpg?t=2025-08-30-16-46-17", "url": "/benedictehelfer", "userName": "benedictehelfer", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 16480284, "profileUrl": "/benedictehelfer", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 16480284, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3522030, "postDate": "2026-09-08T00:29:53.253Z", "rawMarkdown": "https://arcprize.org/blog/astra  had solved arc3 , this competiton .......", "content": "<p><a href=\"https://arcprize.org/blog/astra\" target=\"_blank\">https://arcprize.org/blog/astra</a>  had solved arc3 , this competiton \u2026\u2026.</p>", "replies": [{"id": 3523295, "postDate": "2